{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06765","headline":"香积寺礼拜万廻平等二圣僧塔 · 王昌龄","name":"香积寺礼拜万廻平等二圣僧塔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"真无御化来，借有乘化归。\n如彼双塔内，孰能知是非。\n愚也骇苍生，圣哉爲帝师。\n当爲时世出，不由天地资。\n万廻主此方，平等性无违。\n今我一礼心，亿劫同不移。\n肃肃松柏下，诸天来有时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06765.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06765","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}